camera_control


camera_control command line options:
    -2 <trace options>  : Camera Lib Debug              (Camera Lib)
    -?                  : this message                  (Ada_Lib)
    -a <trace options>  : Ada_Lib library trace options (Ada_Lib)
    -c <directory>      : current directory             (Camera Lib)
    -E                  : simulate camera               (Camera Lib)
    -G <trace options>  : GNOGA traces                  (GNOGA library)
    -h                  : this message                  (Ada_Lib)
    -p <port option>    : port option                   (Camera Lib)
    -P                  : pause                         (Ada_Lib)
    -r                  : remote camera                 (Camera Lib)
    -T <trace options>  : trace options                 (Camera.Lib.Options)
    -v                  : verbose                       (Ada_Lib)
    -V <trace options>  : trace options                 (Video Lib)
    -w <port number>    : Web server port               (GNOGA library)
    -@c                 : trace test condition          (Ada_Lib)
    -@i                 : indent trace                  (Ada_Lib)
    -@p                 : include program in trace      (Ada_Lib)
    -@t                 : include task in trace         (Ada_Lib)
    -@x                 : exclude time in trace         (Ada_Lib)


camera_control trace options -T)
      a               all
      m               main program options
      r               runtime options

CAC ada_lib trace library options (-a)
      a               all
      b               database subscribe
      c               Ada_Lib.Command_Line Trace
      C               Ada_Lib.Configuration Trace
      e               Event
      h               Help
      i               interrupt
      I               Ada_Lib.interface
      l               lock
      m               timer
      M               mail
      o               os
      O               Ada_Lib.Options
      p               parser
      P               database post
      r               run remote, database connect
      R               Ada_Lib.Options.Runstring.Debug
      s               socket
      S               socket Stream
      t               Ada_Lib.Trace
      T               Ada_Lib.Trace_Tasks
      @c              Template Compile
      @d              Template Detail
      @D              Ada_Lib.Directory trace
      @e              Template Evaluate
      @E              Template Expand
      @l              Template Load
      @o              Trace_Options
      @p              Trace Pre and Post Condtion functions
      @s              Strings
      @S              Socket_IO IO
      @t              Ada_Lib.Text
GNOGA_Options library trace options (-G)
      a               all
      m               GNOGA_Ada_Lib Debug
      o               GNOGA options


Camera Lib trace options (-2)
      a               all
      b               Base.debug
      B               Camera.Lib.Base.debug
      c               Configuration.Camera.Debug
      C               camera commands
      g               Widgets.Generic_Table
      l               camera Library
      L               camera library options
      m               Main Window
      s               Trace simulator
      S               configuration.state.Debug
      T               Windows.Top
      V               Trace Video widgets
      @a              Widgets.Adjust debug
      @c              Widgets.Control debug
      @C              Widgets.Configured debug
      @l              List camera commands
      @s              Configuration
      @S              Configuration.Camera.State.Debug

Video Lib trace options (-V)
      a               all
      l               library debug
      o               options debug
